2 CONT >Some chronicles affirm the existence of a [https://www.geni.com/people/Flavio-Sisebuto-conde-de-Coimbra/6000000008462851458 Flavio Sisebuto], judge of the Christians of Coimbra, as the son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Witiza-I
2 CONC -rey-de-los-visigodos/6000000003297183475 Witiza]. Some modern genealogists have come to identify this Sisebutus with the Artobas registered in the Arab chronicles. But if this count really existed, by chronology it would be more 
2 CONC likely that he was Witiza's brother and not the son. <BR>
