2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro Balhes was one of the sons of King Ervigio of the Visigoths of Spain, boasted of having many chroniclers, by Salazar y Castro, Author of the Genealogical Table of Kings of Spain, Another source is the Contemporary Chronicles
2 CONC  of King D.Alfonso III, the Great where his ancestry was refried.
2 CONT
