1 NOTE Maugerato became king of Asturias by usurping throne after Silo King of Asturias died.
2 CONT He was an illigitimate son of Alfonso I whose mother was a Muslim serf. Half brother to Adosinda, and Bermudo.
2 CONT 1: Collins, Roger. Visigothic Spain, 409-711.
2 CONT Blackwell publishing 2004.
2 CONT 2: King, P.D., King Chindasuinth and the first territorial law code of the Visigothic kingdon.
