2 CONT '''GUNDESINDO Eriz''', son of ERO Fernández & his first wife Adosinda --- (-after [947]).  His parentage is confirmed by the charter dated 21 Feb 897 which records that "Gondesindus prolis Erus et Adosinda" accepted as his wife "E
2 CONC nderquina conmento Pala filia dux Menemdus Gutierizi et Ermesinda iermana de domna Geluira regina que fuit mulier de Ordonius rex mater Ranemirus principe", names their children "filius…Suarius, Ermesinda et Adosinda et Froilo…cum
2 CONC  infirmidate nata", records his foundation of churches "inter Durio et Uauga in villa Acibeto…in villa Sanganeto…", and that he committed "filia mea Froilo" to "domna Geluira abatisisa"[743].  "Aloitus Lucidi, Fredenandus Ouecoz, 
2 CONC Fredenandus Alderotiz, Lucidus Aloitis, Froila Gundesindi…Didacus Fernandit, Gundesindus Eroni, Ueremudus Lucidi…" subscribed the charter dated 22 Feb 926 under which "Ranemirus" [brother of Alfonso IV King of Leon] granted "villa
2 CONC …Crexemir" {Creixomil} to "Ermegildus et Mummadomna"[744].  "Sancius...rex" donated “Bustum...latere montis Luanie...Varganum” to Santiago de Compostela by charter dated 25 Aug 927, subscribed by “Gundisaluus Betoniz, Gundesindus 
2 CONC Eroni, Gundulfus Odori, Spasandus, Froila Menendiz, Guther Osoriz, Ordonius, Nunius Osorici, Arias Alvitiz, Cresconius”[745]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ENDERQUINA Menéndez "Pala", daughter of HERMENEGILDO Gutiérrez & his wife Ermesenda Gatóniz (-before [947]).  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by a charter dated 21 Feb 897 which records that "Gondesindus prolis Erus et 
2 CONC Adosinda" accepted as his wife "Enderquina conmento Pala filia dux Menemdus Gutierizi et Ermesinda iermana de domna Geluira regina que fuit mulier de Ordonius rex mater Ranemirus principe", names their children "filius…Suarius, Er
2 CONC mesinda et Adosinda et Froilo…cum infirmidate nata", records his foundation of churches "inter Durio et Uauga in villa Acibeto…in villa Sanganeto…", and that he committed "filia mea Froilo" to "domna Geluira abatisisa"[746]. 
2 CONT
