2 CONT 2.         ARIAS Menéndez (-before 924).  … m ERMESINDA, daughter of ---.  Her marriage is confirmed by the charter dated 11 Jun 962 under which “Giloyra” donated property inherited “inter germanos meos” from “genitoris et genitri
2 CONC cis mee Ariani ducis et Hermesinde auctrix cometisse” to Celanova[326].  same person as …? ERMESINDA Gundesíndez, daughter of GUNDESINDO Eriz & his wife Enderquina Menéndez.  This co-identity is proposed by Mattoso[327]. ….
2 CONT
