2 CONC a; Velasquita Sáncez; y Orbita de Navarre).
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: de Aragon, Urraca Anzarez (Child 1: Sánchez, García I, King of Pamplona, b. 919; Child 2: , Sancha of Pamplona; Child 3: , Urraca of Pamplona; Child 4: , Oneca of Pamplona; Child 5: Sanchez, Velasquita; y Child 6: de Navar
2 CONC re, Orbita)
2 CONT
