1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Fernão Peres de Guimarães==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth circa 1150
2 CONT
2 CONT Fernão Peres de Guimarães (? - 1178 ) was Lord of Melo , nobleman and medieval knight of the Kingdom of Portugal .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Family==
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Pero Fromarigues de Guimarães , married with Usco Godins de Lanhoso, daughter of Godinho Fafes de Lanhoso and Ouroana Mendes de Riba Douro, from whom he had:
2 CONT
2 CONT * D. Martim Fernandes de Riba de Vizela , married to D. Estevainha Soares da Silva, daughter of Soeiro Pires da Silva and Fruilhe Viegas de Lanhoso.
2 CONT * João Fernandes de Riba de Vizela married twice, the first with Marinha Moniz Varela and the second with D. Maria Soares de Sousa, daughter of Soeiro Mendes de Sousa .
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources ==
2 CONT
