1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fortún had several surviving children by his wife Oria, whose parentage has been subject to much speculation: Íñigo Fortúnez Aznar Fortúnez Blasco (Velasco) Fortúnez Lope Fortúnez Oneca Fortúnez, who married firstl
2 CONC y Abdallah ibn Mohammed, Emir of Córdoba, and secondly her cousin Aznar Sánchez of Larraun, grandson of king García Íñiguez, becoming the mother of the future queens Toda Aznárez, wife of Sancho Garcés, and Sancha Aznárez, wife of
2 CONC  king Jimeno Garcés, as well as grandmother of caliph Abd-ar-Rahman III.
