1 NOTE Aznar or Asnar Sánchez (Basque: Aznar Antso, French: Aznard Sanche, Gascon: Aznar Sans; died 836) was the Duke of Gascony[1] from 820. He was the supposed son of Sancho I of Gascony, though he has been identified with Aznar Galínd
2 CONC ez I, Count of Aragon.
