2 CONT TOTA Galindónez (-after Apr 941).  The Codex de Roda names "domna Tota…domnus Redemtus episcopus et domno Miro" as the children of "GalindoAsnari" and his first wife Acibella, stating that Toda married "Uernardi comitis"[44].  The
2 CONC  end 13th century “Crònica d´Alaó Renovada” names “Totam filiam Galindonis comitis Aragonensis” as wife of “Bernardus comes Ripacurcie”, adding that they built the monastery of Ovarra where they were both buried[45].  m BERNARDO [
