2 CONT
2 CONT      Aba Raimúndez de Ribagorza was born circa 945. She was the daughter of Ramón II, conde Ribagorza y Pallars and Gersinde de Fézenzac.2,3,4 Aba Raimúndez de Ribagorza married García I "el de las Manos Blancas", conde de Castill
2 CONC a, son of Fernán, conde de Castilla and Sancha Sánchez de Pamplona, between 958 and 961.5,6,1 Aba Raimúndez de Ribagorza died after 995.1 Aba Raimúndez de Ribagorza was buried in St. Peter's, Cardeña, Burgos Province, Castile.1
