2 CONT ============================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents unknown, but often said to have been a daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Lope-IV-Count-Of-Bigorre/6000000000437081406 Lope IV de Bigorre] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Faquil%C3%A8ne-de-Toulouse/6000000000424707234
2 CONC  Faquilène de Rouergue].
2 CONT
2 CONT The Codex de Roda records that "Garsea Scemenonis" married secondly "domna Dadildi de Paliares soror Regimundi comitis"[193].
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Søster til: Raimund I Count of Pallars and Ribagorza, der også hører til mine aner.
