2 CONT 35. [ALAV302] Froiloba Vermudez (daughter of Vermudo [& Argilo]) married (before 947) [LOIS301] Munio Flainiz (see LOIS).
2 CONT
2 CONT 35.  [ALAV301] Count Fernando Vermudez of Cea (son of Vermudo & Argilo) married [SALD302] Countess Elvira Diaz (see SALDANA COUNTY).
2 CONT
