2 CONT
2 CONT '''Also known as Rodrigo Martins de Nomães'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Born circa 1140
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000013984824781&photo_id=6000000173900050884&position=0 '''A 1386 Vernacular Charter from Portugal,'''] written by the scribe Martim Gonçalves in a fine Johanine ch
2 CONC ancery script and bearing the rubric of D. João I, King of Portugal and founder of the Aviz dynasty. This ms is significant as a very early example of a text in Old Portuguese.
2 CONT * [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p4680.htm#i140526 '''Our Titled Commoner Ancestors''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married =
2 CONT
