2 CONC BVIT PRAELIA CUM I battle with SARRACENIS, ET INTERFECTUS, Saracens, and was killed, EST SAGITTA APUD VISEUM With an arrow's visit PORTUGAL FUIT FILIUS VEREMUNDI ORDONII Portugal's son Veremundus Ordonie OBIIT ERA M SEXAGESIMA QUI
2 CONC NTA III NAS M Obit era 1000 followed by unknown
2 CONT
