2 CONT
2 CONT Bermudo III (c. 1015-1037) 
2 CONT Sancha of León (c. 1020-1067), married Ferdinand I of León 
2 CONT His second wife was Urraca of Navarre, daughter of García Sánchez II of Pamplona
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfonso and Urraca had one daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jimena of León, married Fernando Gundemariz 
