2 CONC e appears with the royal title in the Códice de Roda, but only in a secondary reference, not in his primary entry. When the 905 coup d'état placed his younger half-brother Sancho Garcés on the throne, he or his family may have had
2 CONC  a falling out, as one son was killed while other sons fled into exile.
