2 CONT Defacto ruler of Al Andalus. Crushed his rival who was his father in law, Ghalib Al Mariri.
2 CONT He took part in 57 campaigns and won all of them. He brought in Berber mercenaries and they in turn upset the political order over time. His son was Shanjoul better known as Sanchuelo. His son, Abd Al Malik ruled until he died 100
2 CONC 8. Sanchuelo took over and weakened the Moors power in Iberia.
