2 CONT
2 CONT '''MANSION''' [Loup], son of [LOUP Donat Comte de Bigorre & his wife ---] .  According to Jaurgain, Mansion Loup was the second son of Loup Donat Comte de Bigorre[289].  He cites no primary source which names him, confirms the rel
2 CONC ationship or specifies his patronymic.  It appears that this person, named Mansion, is known only from the patronymic attributed to his son.  It is probable that the alleged family connection with the comtes de Bigorre is speculat
2 CONC ive because the name "Mansio" appears in the supposed family of his presumed paternal grandmother Faquilo. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---.  The name of Mansion’s wife is not known. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Mansion & his wife had [two] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
