2 CONC ughter of GONÇALO Mendes de Sousa & his second wife Dordia Egas de Riba Douro.  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "Condesa D. Elvira de Faya, D. Teresa Gonçalez" as the children of "D. Gonçalo Mendez de Sousa" and hi
