2 CONC bbey of Silos by charter dated 29 Mar 1157, witnessed by "…Maria Andrez, Maria Ylianez de Vila Tella et Gonsalbus Garciez suus filius…Pedro Garciez de Aza…"[150].  "Garcia Garciez filius comite Garcie…cum uxore mea Sancia" donated
