2 CONC h of Spain [in 827][66].  The Vita Hludowici Imperatoris records that Emperor Louis I sent "Bonifatius comes et Donatus…comes…et Adrebaldus Flaviniacensis monasterii abbas" as missi to Septimania [in 838][67].  The chronology sugg
2 CONC ests that he was a different person from Donat, ancestor of the Condes de Bailo, who is shown above.  <br> '''m '''FAQUILO, daughter of [MANSIO] & his wife ---.  "Dompna Faquilo" donated property to the monastery of Saint-Orens de
