2 CONT c)         SANCHA Vásquez .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Gil Vazquez, D. Elvira Vazquez, D. Sancha Vazquez" as the children of "D. Vasco Gil" and his wife "D. Froile", and in another passage that "D. Fernan
