2 CONC time of García Íñiguez, and is listed by the Códice de Roda as being of "another part of the kingdom" of Pamplona.
2 CONT
2 CONT By a popular reconstruction, when King García I supposedly died in 870 while his son and heir Fortún Garcés was imprisoned in Córdoba, García Jiménez is said to have become uncontested regent of the kingdom until he was killed at 
