1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bernard_I,_Count_of_Besal%C3%BA
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00197488&tree=LEO
1 FAMC @F5096010210510109076@
