2 CONC a. They married immediately (despite the fact both of her previous husbands were still alive) and they appear with their twin sons in a charter the next year. Pope Victor II excommunicated Almodis and Ramon for this illegal marria
2 CONC ge until 1056. Together they produced four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Berenguer Ramon II, Count of Barcelona
