2 CONT Emma, comtesse de Périgord[1]
2 CONT *b. circa 900
2 CONT *Father	Wilhelm I, comte de Périgueux et d' Agen b. circa 860, d. circa 920
2 CONT *Mother	Regilindis de Neustrie b. between 860 and 865
2 CONT
2 CONT Emma, comtesse de Périgord was born circa 900. She was the daughter of Wilhelm I, comte de Périgueux et d' Agen and Regilindis de Neustrie. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Emma, comtesse de Périgord married Boson I "le Vieil", comte de la Marche & de Perigord, son of Sulpice, comte en Limousin, abbé laïque de Charroux and N. N. de Limoges, in 944.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT *Boson I "le Vieil", comte de la Marche & de Perigord b. circa 924, d. circa 968
2 CONT
