1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Vasco Martins da Cunha, "o Seco", 7 senhor de Tábua=
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.asbrap.org.br/documentos/revistas/rev24_art4.pdf '''VASCO MARTINS DA CUNHA,'''] the Seco. Son of precedent and of Joana de Nomães. Was born c. 1260 and passed away in 1325. It was the 7th. Lord of the Morgado de Tábua
2 CONC . He married Senhorinha Fernandes de Chacim, daughter of Fernão Gonçalves Chacino and Major Afonso de Cambra. 
2 CONT * [https://www.genealogiahistoria.com.br/index_genealogia.asp?categoria=2&categoria2=1&subcategoria=335 '''Vasco Martins da Cunha , Seco,'''] was the 7th Lord of interest and Herdade De Tábua, 3rd Lord of the Morgado De Tábua, Kni
2 CONC ght Hidalgo, chief butler of Count D. Pedro (1309-23), deceased before 1325. He was married to Miss Fernandes Chancinho, deceased in 1330, daughter of Fernon Gonçalves Chancinho, Horseman, and Mor Afonso de Cambra. Vasco and Signo
2 CONC rinha had among others:  
2 CONT * [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p3355.htm#i100773 '''Our Royal Titled Noble Ancestors''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Married: '''Senhorinha Fernandes Chancinho,''' widow of Ruy Gonçalves Bifardel (son of Gonçalo Viegas de Portocarrero, Alfeirão , and Sancha Peres da Veiga ), daughter of Fernão Gonçalves Chancinho and Mayor Affonso de Cambra.
2 CONT
2 CONT = Children =
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Theresa Vasques da Cunha,''' married to Fernan Gomez de Guzman, son of Gomez Perez de Guzman and Arabuena Armildes.
2 CONT * '''Martim Vasques da Cunha,''' married to Violante Lopes Pacheco , daughter of Dom Lopo Fernandes Pacheco and his first wife, Maria Gomes Taveira . Martim died before 1333, and Violante married for the second time, with Diogo Af
2 CONC fonso de Sousa , son of Dom Affonso Dinis, Infante de Portugal , and Maria Pires Ribeiro de Sousa .
2 CONT * '''Joanna Vasques da Cunha,'''  married to Ruy Vasques de Azevedo , son of Vasco Paes de Azevedo and Maria Rodrigues de Vasconcellos [cited in 1.4.] .
2 CONT * '''Berenguela Vasques da Cunha,''' married to Gonçalo Vasques de Azevedo , son of Vasco Paes de Azevedo and Maria Rodrigues de Vasconcellos [cited in 1.3.] .
2 CONT
