2 CONT '''m''' ALDARA Annes de Sousa, daughter of JOAO García de Sousa "el Pinto" & his wife Urraca Fernández Pellegrin.  The Livro Velho names "D. Esteuam Annes d´Alegrete e D. Aldara Annes e D. Eluira Annes, e D. Sancha Annes" as the c
2 CONC hildren of "D. João Garcia" and his wife "D. Urraca Fernandes", adding that Aldara married "D. Gomes Gonçalues Giron"[1202].  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Estevan Annez sin hijos, D. Aldara Annez, D. Elvira 
2 CONC Annez, D. Sancha Annez no casó ni tuvo hijos" as the children of "D. Juan Garcia de Sousa el Pinto" and his wife "D. Urraca Fernandez", recording in a later passage that "D. Gomes Gonçalez Giron" married "Doña Aldara Anez"[1203]. 
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT  Gómez & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT *a)         JUANA Gómez Girón .  The Livro Velho names "Joanna Gomes molher de D. Nuno de Lara" as the child of "D. Gomes Gonçalues Giron" and his wife[1204].  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Juana Gomez" as th
2 CONC e child of "D. Gomes Gonçalez Giron" and his wife "Doña Aldara Anez", recording in an earlier passage that "D. Nuño Gonçalez de Lara" married "D. Juana Gomez" and that the couple was childless[1205].  The testament of "Nuño Gonzal
2 CONC ez", dated 15 Jan 1286, names "doña Joanna Gomez mi muger…don Joan mi hermano"[1206]. <br> '''m''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Nu%C3%B1o-Gonz%C3%A1lez-de-Lara-y-Le%C3%B3n/6000000008470064331 NUÑO González de Lara], son of NUÑO Go
2 CONC nzález de Lara "el Bueno" & his wife Teresa Alfonso (-Lisbon 1291). 
