2 CONC rii comitis filii sui"[875].  "Petrus Bernardi comes" sold his rights "in villa Calsan" to the monastery of Camon, with the consent of "Rodgerii comitis filii sui", by charter dated to [1070][876].  He succeeded in 1074 as Comte d
