2 CONC m secondly ESTEFANÍA de Besalú, daughter of GUILLEM [II] "Trunus"[885] Conde de Besalú his wife Estefania de Provence.  Her marriage is confirmed by the charter dated Dec 1129 of her son “Rogerius Fuxi comes, filius Rogerii et Ste
2 CONC phaniæ”[886].  1095.  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not yet been identified.  Comte Roger [II] & his second wife had four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          ROGER [III] de Foix (-[1147/48]).  “Rogerius comes Fuxensis…et filius meus Rogerius” restored property to the abbey of Alet by charter dated 1108[887].  He succeeded his father in 1124 as Comte de Foix.   
